A new release, v.0.15.1, of CK-ERP, has been posted at SourceForge.Net,
http://sourceforge.net/projects/ck-erp .

New features include,
1.Connector for Horde Framework 3.0.5
2.A new i18n module
3.Improvement to the TikiWiki connector
4.Restriction on access to the Administration module
5.Daily Attendance Report

Special thank is due to Shashank Agrawal for providing the initial
version of the Daily Attendance Report.

CK-ERP is an open source accounting/ERP/CRM system that runs on top of
eGroupWare / Horde / TikiWiki / phpBB.  It comprises 20 modules -
Administration, i18n, Contact Management, Customer Relationship,
Customer Self Service, Vendor Relationship, Ledger, Bank
Reconciliation, Inventory, Service, AP, AR, PO, SO, Quotation, POS for
Cashier, POS for Manager, HR, Staff Self Service and Payroll.
Operating platform can either be LAMP or LAPP.  It provides accounting
and back office functionalities to SMEs and utilizes egw to administer
accounts/groups.  Please report error and suggestion to the discussion
group / mailing list, CK-ERP-en(at)googlegroups.com or
CK-ERP-zh_CN(at)googlegroups.com .  General history and expected
development is available at the discussion group's Archive.

Latest tested working environment:
FC4, Apache 2.0.54, Postgres 8.0.3 / MySQL 4.1.11, eGW 1.0.0.009
FC4, Apache 2.0.54, Postgres 8.0.3 / MySQL 4.1.11, Horde 3.0.5
FC4, Apache 2.0.54, Postgres 8.0.3 / MySQL 4.1.11, TikiWiki 1.9
FC4, Apache 2.0.54, MySQL 4.1.11, phpBB 2.0.17

Demo is located at,
http://ck-erp.sourceforge.net (English)
http://www.ck-erp.org (Simplified Chinese)
http://www.ck-erp.org/horde/login.php (operating within Horde)
http://ck-erp.org/tikiwiki/tiki-index.php (operating within TikiWiki)
http://ck-erp.org/phpbb/login.php (operating within phpBB)

Download is available from,
http://sourceforge.net/projects/ck-erp
http://gro.clinux.org/projects/ck-ledger
http://cosoft.org.cn/projects/ck-ledger
http://sf.linuxforum.net/projects/ck-ledger

